# TASK

Create exactly {{ num_questions }} exam questions based on the KNOWLEDGE BASE.

- Difficulty level: {{ difficulty }}
{% if question_types %}- Allowed question types: {{ question_types | join(", ") }}. Distribute the questions across these types.
{% else %}- Use open-ended questions.
